UPDATE public.stories 
SET 
    content_ko = '효도는 유교 사상의 핵심 가치로서, 조선 시대 이래 한국 사회의 윤리적 기반을 형성해온 전통적 덕목이다. 자식은 부모에 대한 무조건적 존경과 봉양을 실천함으로써 인륜의 근본을 지키고자 하였으며, 이는 단순한 의무를 넘어 도덕적 정체성의 표상이었다. 그러나 20세기 후반 이후 급속한 산업화, 도시화, 그리고 핵가족 구조의 확산은 이러한 전통적 효도 관념에 근본적 전환을 요구하였다.  

현대 한국 사회에서는 효도의 실천 양상이 다층적으로 재구성되고 있다. 경제적 부양의 책임이 가족 내부에서 국가 복지 체계로 점차 이전되면서, 젊은 세대는 물질적 지원보다 정서적 동행, 소통, 그리고 존중을 효도의 핵심 요소로 인식한다. 특히 고령화 심화와 노인 빈곤 문제의 심각성 속에서, ‘봉양’의 개념은 단순한 생계 유지에서 벗어나, 부모의 자율성과 삶의 질을 보장하는 방향으로 진화하고 있다.  

이러한 변화는 효도의 본질을 훼손하기보다는, 현대적 맥락에서 그 의미를 재정의하려는 사회적 성찰의 결과라 할 수 있다. 궁극적으로, 효도는 더 이상 일방적 희생이 아니라, 상호 존중과 연대를 기반으로 한 관계성의 실천임을 새롭게 인식해야 한다.',
    content_id = 'Bakti merupakan nilai inti dalam pemikiran Konfusianisme dan merupakan budi luhur tradisional yang telah membentuk fondasi etis masyarakat Korea sejak masa Dinasti Joseon. Anak-anak berupaya memelihara dasar hubungan kemanusiaan dengan secara tanpa syarat menghormati dan merawat orang tua, suatu praktik yang melampaui sekadar kewajiban formal dan menjadi simbol identitas moral. Namun, sejak akhir abad ke-20, industrialisasi dan urbanisasi yang pesat, serta meluasnya struktur keluarga inti, menuntut perubahan mendasar dalam konsep tradisional bakti ini.

Dalam masyarakat Korea modern, bentuk praktik bakti sedang direkonstruksi secara multilapis. Seiring beralihnya tanggung jawab pemeliharaan ekonomi dari lingkup keluarga ke sistem kesejahteraan negara, generasi muda kini memandang kehadiran emosional, komunikasi yang tulus, serta penghormatan sebagai inti bakti—lebih daripada dukungan materi semata. Terutama dalam konteks penuaan populasi yang semakin parah dan meningkatnya kemiskinan di kalangan lansia, konsep ‘merawat’ telah berevolusi: tidak lagi sekadar memastikan kelangsungan hidup fisik orang tua, melainkan juga menjamin otonomi dan kualitas hidup mereka.

Perubahan ini bukanlah penghancuran esensi bakti, melainkan hasil refleksi sosial untuk mendefinisikan ulang maknanya dalam konteks modern. Pada akhirnya, bakti harus dipahami kembali bukan sebagai pengorbanan sepihak, melainkan sebagai praktik relasional yang berlandaskan saling menghormati dan solidaritas.',
    content_en = 'Filial piety is a core value of Confucian thought and a traditional virtue that has formed the ethical foundation of Korean society since the Joseon Dynasty. Children sought to uphold the fundamental principles of human relationships by practicing unconditional respect for and care of their parents—an act that transcended mere duty and served as a symbol of moral identity. However, since the late twentieth century, rapid industrialization, urbanization, and the widespread adoption of nuclear family structures have demanded a fundamental transformation of this traditional conception of filial piety.

In contemporary Korean society, the practice of filial piety is being reconfigured in multifaceted ways. As the responsibility for economic support gradually shifts from the family to the national welfare system, younger generations increasingly regard emotional companionship, sincere communication, and respect—not material assistance—as the core elements of filial piety. Especially amid deepening population aging and the growing severity of elderly poverty, the concept of ‘supporting’ has evolved beyond mere subsistence maintenance toward safeguarding parents’ autonomy and quality of life.

This shift does not erode the essence of filial piety; rather, it reflects a societal introspection aimed at redefining its meaning within a modern context. Ultimately, filial piety must be newly understood not as one-sided sacrifice, but as a relational practice grounded in mutual respect and solidarity.',
    content_tokens = '[{"t":"효도는","l":"효도"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"유교","l":"유교"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"사상의","l":"사상"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"핵심","l":"핵심"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"가치로서","l":"가치"},{"t":",","l":","},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"조선","l":"조선"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"시대","l":"시대"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"이래","l":"이래"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"한국","l":"한국"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"사회의","l":"사회"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"윤리적","l":"윤리적"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"기반을","l":"기반"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"형성해온","l":"형성하다"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"전통적","l":"전통적"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"덕목이다","l":"덕목"},{"t":".","l":"."},{"t":"\n","l":"\n"},{"t":"자식은","l":"자식"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"부모에","l":"부모"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"대한","l":"대하다"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"무조건적","l":"무조건적"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"존경과","l":"존경"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"봉양을","l":"봉양"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"실천함으로써","l":"실천하다"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"인륜의","l":"인륜"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"근본을","l":"근본"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"지키고자","l":"지키다"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"하였으며","l":"하다"},{"t":",","l":","},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"이것은","l":"이것"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"단순한","l":"단순한"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"의무를","l":"의무"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"넘어","l":"넘어"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"도덕적","l":"도덕적"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"정체성의","l":"정체성"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"표상이었다","l":"표상"},{"t":".","l":"."},{"t":"\n","l":"\n"},{"t":"그러나","l":"그러나"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"20세기","l":"20세기"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"후반","l":"후반"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"이후","l":"이후"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"급속한","l":"급속한"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"산업화","l":"산업화"},{"t":",","l":","},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"도시화","l":"도시화"},{"t":",","l":","},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"그리고","l":"그리고"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"핵가족","l":"핵가족"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"구조의","l":"구조"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"확산은","l":"확산"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"이러한","l":"이러한"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"전통적","l":"전통적"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"효도","l":"효도"},{"t":" ","l":" "},{"t":"관